WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.793
Look at this footage from Ecuador.

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:03.795
It is a bunch of masked men

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:05.755
who invaded a TV station

00:00:05.755 --> 00:00:07.215
while it was still live on the air.

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:07.632
Ecuador is a place

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:09.509
that has historically been peaceful

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:10.093
and beautiful.

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:10.677
Recently, it's

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.345
been descending into chaos.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.263
A few weeks ago,

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:14.389
this drug lord

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:15.974
who was serving 34 years

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.392
in prison, escaped.

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:18.852
Then, all hell broke loose.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.729
Prisons were taken over by the inmates.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.980
Guards were held hostage.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.565
Police officers abducted.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:23.898
And then, of course,

00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:25.358
this TV station incident.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.276
Stuff like this is happening

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.360
all over the country.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:27.986
And the reason it's happening

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.196
now is because the cocaine trade

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.114
is changing.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:32.615
A lot more drugs are going to Europe.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:33.783
Drug cartels are using

00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:34.951
this port in Ecuador

00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:36.286
as a major trade hub.

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.203
The number of violent deaths

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.705
has doubled since last year.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:39.706
A presidential candidate

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.623
that was running on

00:00:40.623 --> 00:00:42.709
anti-corruption was assassinated

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.127
as well as the prosecutor

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:45.128
who was investigating

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:46.671
this TV station incident.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:49.966
So now, like Mexico and Colombia, Ecuador

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:51.885
is descending into a drug war

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.845
between these gangs and the government.

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:55.805
And it is tearing the country apart

00:00:55.805 --> 00:00:56.848
I'm going to keep following this.

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:57.807
If you want to better understand

00:00:57.807 --> 00:00:59.642
global politics, follow along for more.

